  "footnotes": [],
  "transcriber_notes": [
   "Rows: part 1 = 74 as printed (臺北 41 incl. 臺北 支那 rows, 臺南 1, 高雄 18, 總計 3, 大正十三/十二/十一年 9); part 2 = 6 as printed.",
   "Row labels combine the printed 州 (臺北/臺南/高雄), 國籍 (支那 with 省, or country) and 體性 (男/女/計); 〃 = ditto (男) as printed. 臺北 rows are printed on p0067 (pp. 82-83), the single 臺南 row (支那 福建省 男) at the foot of p0067, 高雄 and 總計 on p0068 (pp. 84-85). 臺南 has no other row printed.",
   "Each row runs across the spread: 渡航者 columns 農業 .. 家事使用人 on the left page (pp. 82/84), 無職業 and 計 at the left of the right page (pp. 83/85), then 歸航者 columns 農業 .. 計.",
   "Row 'Table 59 part 1, 高雄 支那 福建省 男', col '歸航者 — 計': last digit damaged by a blemish, reads '43' + a damaged 5-or-7 (enlarged crop); written [?]. The components of that row (8+1+127+73+1+219+6) sum to 435 (the 高雄 支那 計 男 total 762 also implies 435), but the printed digit was not settled by a permitted rule.",
   "Row sums checked (python): every 渡航者 and 歸航者 row's printed 計 equals the sum of its 10 occupation columns (all 74 rows; 福建 男 高雄 歸航者 計 not checkable).",
   "Column sums checked: 臺北 支那 計 = sum of provinces (男, 女, all 22 columns, counting 湖南 〃 and 比律賓 〃 / 和蘭 〃 as 男); 臺北 合計 = 支那 計 + other countries; 總計 = 臺北 合計 + 臺南 + 高雄 合計 (男, 女, 計); 男 + 女 = 計 in every 合計/總計/year block. All reconcile.",
   "Part 2 (printed under the line '大正十年以前ハ調査ヲ異ニスルヲ以テ次ニ累年ヲ掲ク', with its own column headings): rows 男+女=計 reconcile, and each row's 計 equals the sum of its 7 occupation columns for both 渡航者 and 歸航者. Its 計 columns (渡航者 and 歸航者) are printed on the right page (p. 85).",
   "The 同 十二年/十一年 etc. rows of part 1 are as printed; 同 = ditto of 大正.",
   "Empty-nil cells printed as … are written '…'."
